OL,3,AOasis will not headline Glastonbury
OL,4,A2027, organiser Emily Eavis confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FOasis may be back on tour next summer
OL,7,Fbut they will not be playing
OL,8,FGlastonbury Festival, according to
OL,9,Fco-organiser Emily Eavis.
OL,11,FThe band announced a series of 2027
OL,12,Fgigs across the UK, Ireland, Europe and
OL,13,Fthe US last week, leaving a potentially
OL,14,FGlastonbury-shaped hole in their
OL,15,Fcalendar.
OL,17,FOasis are due to play concerts at
OL,18,FManchester City's Etihad Stadium on the
OL,19,FFriday and Saturday of Glastonbury, but
OL,20,Fdon't currently have their own gig
OL,21,Fscheduled on the Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
